  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Desert locust response to mitigate impacts on food security and livelihoods</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will target locust-affected areas of Ethiopia, Kenya and Somalia. Interventions will include
efforts to support to desert locust control efforts  aligned with the revised FAO Desert Locust Crisis Appeal for
Rapid Response and Anticipatory Action in the Greater Horn of Africa and will fund activities under component 1: ?Curb the spread of desert locust?.</narrative>
  </description>
